          "label": "Authorized Representative"
        },
        {
          "type": "Control",
          "scope": "#/properties/attachments/properties/additional",
          "options": {
            "widget": "AttachmentArray"
          },
          "label": "Supporting Documents"
        }
      ],
      "label": "18. Certification",
      "options": {
        "description": "By signing this application, I certify (1) to the statements contained in the list of certifications** and (2) that the statements herein are true, complete and accurate to the best of my knowledge. I also provide the required assurances** and agree to comply with any resulting terms if I accept an award. I am aware that any false, fictitious, or fraudulent statements or claims may subject me to criminal, civil, or administrative penalties. (U.S. Code, Title 18, Section 1001)\n\n** This list of certifications and assurances, or an internet site where you may obtain this list, is contained in the announcement or agency specific instructions."
      }
    }
  ]
}
